          "settings": {
            "tab_title": "Device Management",
            "tab_content": "<p><strong>Device<br/>Management<br/></strong>Monitor your devices' hardware, software, and <br/>performance. Support device commands like <br/>locking, factory resetting, and file synchronization. <br/>Securely lock lost or stolen devices, restore devices <br/>to factory settings, enable device function like <br/>location, wifi or bluetooth.</p>",
