    "custom_liquid_wP4qxK": {
      "type": "custom-liquid",
      "settings": {
        "no_margins": true,
        "custom_liquid": "<style>\n\n    .mdm-3 h2 {\n        text-align: center;\n        font-size: 3vw;\n        margin-bottom: 2vw;\n        font-weight: 700;\n        margin-top: 3vw;\n    }\n\n    .mdm-3 .challenge-box {\n        background-color: #f5f5fc;\n        padding: 1.5rem;\n        border-radius: 1rem;\n        display: flex;\n        flex-direction: row;\n        align-items: flex-start;\n        gap: 2vw;\n        max-width: 73vw;\n        margin: 1.5vw auto;\n    }\n\n    .mdm-3 .text {\n        flex: 1;\n    }\n\n    .mdm-3 strong {\n        font-weight: 800;\n    }\n\n    .mdm-3 .text h3 {\n        margin: 0 0 1vw;\n        text-align: left;\n        font-size: 1.2vw;\n        font-weight: 800;\n        margin-top: 1vw;\n    }\n\n    .mdm-3 .text p {\n        margin: 0.3rem 0;\n    }\n\n    .mdm-3-icon {\n        display: flex;\n        align-items: center;\n        justify-content: center;\n        height: 10vw;\n        width: 6vw;\n    }\n\n    @media (max-width: 768px) {\n        .mdm-3 .challenge-box {\n            flex-direction: column;\n            text-align: left;\n        }\n        .mdm-3 h2 {\n            font-size: 1.5rem;\n            margin: 7vw auto 3vw;\n        }\n        .mdm-3 .challenge-box {\n            max-width: 98vw;\n        }\n        .mdm-3-icon {\n            height: 22vw;\n            width: 22vw;\n            margin: 0 auto;\n        }\n        .mdm-3 .text h3 {\n            font-size: 4.5vw;\n            text-align: center;\n        }\n        .mdm-3 .text {\n            text-align: center;\nfont-size: 3.1vw;\n        }\n\n    }\n</style>\n<div class=\"mdm-3\">\n    <h2>Are You Also Facing <br> These Challenges?</h2>\n    <div class=\"challenge-box\">\n        <div class=\"mdm-3-icon\"><img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0830/0573/5193/files/mdm-8.webp\" /></div>\n        <div class=\"text\">\n            <h3>Employee Privacy</h3>\n            <p><strong>BYOD Issues</strong><br>Employees worry MDM on their phones can see private things (like photos, location, calls), which feels like a privacy problem.</p>\n            <p><strong>Trust Problem</strong><br>Making them install MDM can make employees upset and feel the company controls their personal phone too much.</p>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"challenge-box\">\n        <div class=\"mdm-3-icon\"><img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0830/0573/5193/files/mdm-9.webp\" /></div>\n        <div class=\"text\">\n            <h3>Bad User Experience and Less Freedom</h3>\n            <p><strong>Limited Features</strong><br>MDM rules (like blocking app installs, limiting internet) can make the device harder to use and slow down work.</p>\n            <p><strong>Slow Downs</strong><br>Some MDM apps can use up phone power and make it run slower.</p>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"challenge-box\">\n        <div class=\"mdm-3-icon\"><img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0830/0573/5193/files/mdm-10.webp\" /></div>\n        <div class=\"text\">\n            <h3>Legal and Compliance Problems:</h3>\n            <p>\n                <strong>Where Data Stays</strong><br>Companies in different countries need to make sure where the MDM keeps data follows local laws\n                (like Europe's GDPR, China's rules about personal info).\n            </p>\n            <p><strong>Is Watching OK?</strong><br>Some places have strict rules about watching what employees do on their devices, and doing it without asking can cause legal trouble.</p>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"challenge-box\">\n        <div class=\"mdm-3-icon\"><img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0830/0573/5193/files/mdm-11.webp\" /></div>\n        <div class=\"text\">\n            <h3>Tech Troubles:</h3>\n            <p>\n                <strong>Works on Everything?</strong><br>It's hard to make MDM rules work the same on different phones (like iPhones and Androids) and computers,\n                and you need to manage them all together.\n            </p>\n            <p><strong>Old Stuff Working Together?</strong><br>Connecting MDM to the company's old computer systems (like the ones for money or logins) can be tricky and expensive.</p>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"challenge-box\">\n        <div class=\"mdm-3-icon\"><img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0830/0573/5193/files/mdm-12.webp\" /></div>\n        <div class=\"text\">\n            <h3>Money and Not Sure If It's Worth It:</h3>\n            <p><strong>Hidden Costs</strong><br>Besides paying for the MDM software, there's also money for training people, keeping it running, and maybe talking to lawyers.</p>\n            <p><strong>Too Big for Small Guys?</strong><br>Small companies might think MDM costs too much for what they really need.</p>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"challenge-box\">\n        <div class=\"mdm-3-icon\"><img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0830/0573/5193/files/mdm-13.webp\" /></div>\n        <div class=\"text\">\n            <h3>Stuck with One Company:</h3>\n            <p><strong>Hard to Switch</strong><br>If you rely too much on just one MDM company, it might cost a lot to change to a different one later.</p>\n            <p><strong>Slow Updates</strong><br>Some companies don't update their MDM quickly for new phones or other devices (like smart gadgets).</p>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"challenge-box\">\n        <div class=\"mdm-3-icon\"><img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0830/0573/5193/files/mdm-14.webp\" /></div>\n        <div class=\"text\">\n            <h3>Data Safety Problem:</h3>\n            <p><strong>Big Target</strong><br>The MDM system itself can be a target for hackers, and if they get in, all the phones are in danger.</p>\n            <p><strong>Too Much Power</strong><br>If people inside the company with admin rights use them the wrong way, data could leak or bad things could happen.</p>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n</div>"
      }
    },
